  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin-left: 0.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span wfd-id=\"2\">La tarde de este jueves, 19 de noviembre, se ha presentado en el sal&oacute;n de actos de Caja Rural Onda&nbsp;</span>el libro de su director general&nbsp;Vicent Prades Albalat DE SINDICATO AGR&Iacute;COLA A COOPERATIVA (1920-1945) El triunfo de una odisea imposible</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\">,<strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</strong>editado por la entidad financiera, su Fundaci&oacute;n y la Cooperativa Agr&iacute;cola, que cumple 100 a&ntilde;os, motivo de esta edici&oacute;n.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193348.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193352.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193403.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193422.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193422\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193439.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193505.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193505\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibrecooperativa/img_20201119_193523.jpg\" alt=\"img_20201119_193523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https